@@ PE5 | Hybrid
The insurance regulator expects strict controls in the first release, while the business wants a quick, simple launch. What should the project manager do?
A) Align early on mandatory requirements and plan a phased scope around them
B) Launch the simple version and add the controls if the regulator insists later
