@@ PE5 | Predictive | multi
Which two practices help manage stakeholders' expectations about schedule uncertainty? (Choose two.)
A) Presenting dates as ranges with confidence levels
B) Explaining the key assumptions and risks behind the forecast
C) Promising an exact date to give stakeholders certainty
D) Hiding risks to avoid worrying stakeholders
E) Secretly padding every estimate without telling anyone
= A, B
? Honest ranges and transparent assumptions help stakeholders understand uncertainty and make informed decisions.

@@ PE6 | Agile
At a review, one stakeholder requests a major change that conflicts with another stakeholder's needs. What should happen?
