= A
? The product owner balances competing stakeholder needs and decides based on value, communicating the reasons.

@@ PE6 | Predictive
A delivered component failed in the customer's tests, and customer satisfaction has dropped. What should the project manager do?
A) Find the cause, agree corrective action and inform the customer
B) Replace the component quietly and say nothing more about the failure
C) Argue that the customer's test conditions were unrealistic and unfair
