@@ PE8 | Predictive
A project team is reduced from 16 to 10 members, including the project manager. How many fewer communication channels are there?
A) 75
B) 6
C) 45
D) 120
= A
? 16 people: 16 × 15 / 2 = 120 channels. 10 people: 10 × 9 / 2 = 45 channels. The reduction is 75.

